PP16 was designed and developed by Bartholomew Harner, with implementation
assistance from the OpenAI Codex AI assistant.

PIXELplus 256 by Chris Chadwick is acknowledged as a workflow and behaviour
reference.  It is not PP16 source code.  See section 10 for the complete
credit and reference notice.

This checkout's guide describes version 1.1 development.  Its current build
is in out\medium; copy PP16.EXE and PP16UI.P16 together to run it under DOS.
The frozen version 1.0 installation package includes its own 1.0 user guide.

PP16 saves important work carefully, but no software can protect against every
possible hardware, power or media failure.  Keep copies of work that matters.

